;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; PAGE-CUED COPY OF ACTION 7001 - generated by tools/endings/make_cue_anim.py.
; Do not hand-edit the frame list; regenerate it instead.
;
; Same frames and same entrances as 7001, except that the last frame of each
; shot WAITS instead of running out on gameticks. The ending text mod
; (external/mods/sfaz_ending_text.lua) advances it with ModifyExplod / animelem
; as the player pages through the text, so the shots change when the words do.
;
; The waits are a large finite duration, NOT -1, and that distinction is load
; bearing. Animation.Action() begins "if a.curFrame().Time <= 0 { next() }", so
; a -1 frame does not hold - it falls through, and next() then skips past every
; following -1 to the next frame with a positive duration. A -1 holds in exactly
; one place: the final frame of the action. Using it anywhere else makes every
; cue land on the last shot and the earlier sprites never appear at all.
;
; Action 7001 is left untouched and is still what plays if the mod is absent.
;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
